                                    <span class="text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0">•</span>
                                    <span>Prices are in INR (Indian Rupees) unless otherwise stated</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex gap-3">
                                    <span class="text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0">•</span>
                                    <span>Additional taxes may apply based on local regulations</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
